hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1680","**\nNarrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar and Yahya ibn Hakim: They said, \"Narrated to us Yahya ibn Sa'id, narrated to us Ibn 'Ajlan, from Bukayr ibn 'Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj, from Busr ibn Sa'id, from Zaynab, the wife of 'Abdullah ibn Mas'ud (RA), from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\n'When one of you women attends the mosque, let her not touch any perfume.'\"\n\nYahya ibn Hakim added, \"He (Bukayr) said: 'He narrated it to me, and he said: She heard the Prophet (ﷺ).'\""
